{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>תשוקתו</b> Twice in the Masorah: here and the other: אני לדודי ועלי תשוקתו. And this is what the Sages said: There are two longings — the longing of the wicked for transgression, as stated: ואליך תשוקתו, and the longing of the Holy One, blessed be He, upon Israel, as stated: אני לדודי ודודי לי ועלי תשוקתו."], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:15:37.867177999Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}